{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46658","headline":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见秋月 · 齐己","name":"荆州新秋病起杂题一十五首 病起见秋月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"病起见秋月，正当三五时。\n清光应鉴我，幽思更同谁。\n惜坐身犹倦，牵吟气尚羸。\n明年七十六，约此健相期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46658.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46658","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}